cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SlangVision in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SlangVision: GPU training augmentation for PyTorch in Slang"
abstract: >-
  SlangVision runs torchvision-style training augmentation on NVIDIA GPUs,
  with a separate random draw for every image, compiled into a few fused
  Slang kernels.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tatar
    given-names: Tekin
repository-code: "https://github.com/tekintatar/slangvision"
url: "https://github.com/tekintatar/slangvision"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - data-augmentation
  - computer-vision
  - gpu
  - cuda
  - pytorch
  - slang
